data: {"type":"start-step","request":{"body":{"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"<workspace_skills>\nAvailable skills:\n- meeting-notes (/skills/meeting-notes) - 把杂乱会议笔记整理成结构化纪要（决议/待办/风险），并写入工作区约定路径。\n- research-brief (/skills/research-brief) - 围绕主题产出调研简报（要点、结论、出处线索），并写入约定 output 路径。\n- weekly-report (/skills/weekly-report) - 从素材生成周报草稿（本周完成/进行中/风险/下周计划），并写入约定 output 路径。\n</workspace_skills>"},{"role":"system","content":"You are the local Office Agent Runtime for UI Lab Agent Workbench. Respond in Chinese unless the user writes in another language. Use Workspace filesystem tools (ls, read_file, write_file, edit_file, …) inside the authorized root. Office skills live under /skills (meeting-notes, weekly-report, research-brief). When a request matches a skill: workspace_list_skills or workspace_search_skills → workspace_activate_skill → workspace_read_skill → follow SKILL.md → write deliverable under the skill output path. Deliverable paths: /output/meeting-notes/, /output/weekly-report/, /output/research-brief/. MCP docs/calendar connectors are not connected in this session; use local Workspace FS and skills only. All file paths must be virtual workspace paths starting with / (e.g. /notes/a.md, /output/meeting-notes/notes.md). Never use host absolute paths (/Users/..., /home/..., drive letters). Never paste operator host paths into tools. Prefer planning briefly, then read before write. Writes and deletes require user approval. Do not claim to be a remote multi-tenant production cluster — this is a local office sidecar.\n\nYou have access to a workspace filesystem. All file paths must start with a /.\n\n- ls: list files in a directory (requires absolute path)\n- read_file: read a file from the filesystem\n- write_file: write to a file in the filesystem\n- edit_file: edit a file in the filesystem\n- delete_file: delete a file from the filesystem\n- stat: get file or directory metadata\n- mkdir: create a directory\n- rmdir: remove a directory\n- list_tree: list files and directories with depth control\n- list_files: list files and directories with depth control (alias)\n- glob: find files matching a pattern (e.g., \"**/*.ts\")\n- grep: search for text within files\n\nBest practices:\n- Read files before editing or overwriting existing content.\n- Prefer offset/limit in read_file for large files.\n- edit_file old_string must match exactly and be unique.\n- Do not include read_file line number prefixes in edit_file old_string/new_string.\n\nYou can manage workspace skills.\n\nImportant:\n- Access skills with workspace skill tools only.\n- Do not use sandbox commands (for example: execute_command, ls /skills, cat /skills/...) to inspect skills.\n- Use dedicated skill read tools for references, scripts, and assets.\n\nUse these tools:\n- workspace_list_skills: list available skills\n- workspace_search_skills: search skill instructions\n- workspace_read_skill: read skill instructions\n- workspace_activate_skill: activate a skill for this session\n- workspace_deactivate_skill: deactivate a skill\n- workspace_read_skill_reference: read skill reference files\n- workspace_read_skill_script: read skill scripts\n- workspace_read_skill_asset: read skill assets"},{"role":"user","content":"请使用 ls 工具列出工作区根目录 / ，然后用一句话中文总结有哪些目录。"}],"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"ls","description":"List files and directories in a workspace directory","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"default":"/","description":"Directory path to list (default: /)","type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","description":"Read file content with optional line range (offset/limit). Prefer targeted reads for large files.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the file to read"},"offset":{"default":0,"description":"Line offset to start reading from (0-indexed)","type":"number"},"limit":{"default":2000,"description":"Maximum number of lines to read","type":"number"}},"required":["file_path"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","description":"Write content to a file. Existing files require overwrite=true; parent directories can be created automatically.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the file to write"},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Content to write to the file"},"overwrite":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to overwrite the file if it already exists","type":"boolean"},"create_parent_dirs":{"default":true,"description":"Whether to create parent directories if needed","type":"boolean"}},"required":["file_path","content"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"edit_file","description":"Edit a file by replacing exact text.\n\nUsage:\n- Read the file first and copy the exact text for old_string.\n- old_string must be unique unless replace_all=true.\n- Preserve indentation and whitespace exactly.\n- If read_file output includes line numbers, do not include those prefixes in old_string/new_string.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the file to edit"},"old_string":{"type":"string","description":"String to be replaced (must match exactly)"},"new_string":{"type":"string","description":"String to replace with"},"replace_all":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to replace all occurrences","type":"boolean"}},"required":["file_path","old_string","new_string"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"delete_file","description":"Delete a file from the filesystem. Use recursive=true to remove a directory","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"file_path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the file to delete"},"recursive":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to delete directories recursively","type":"boolean"}},"required":["file_path"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"stat","description":"Get file or directory metadata","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the file or directory"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"mkdir","description":"Create a directory in the filesystem","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the directory to create"},"recursive":{"default":true,"description":"Whether to create parent directories if needed (default: true)","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"rmdir","description":"Remove a directory from the filesystem","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string","description":"Absolute path to the directory to remove"},"recursive":{"default":false,"description":"Whether to remove contents recursively","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_tree","description":"List files and directories recursively with optional depth control","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"default":"/","description":"Base directory path (default: /)","type":"string"},"max_depth":{"default":3,"description":"Maximum depth to traverse (default: 3)","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"list_files","description":"List files and directories recursively with optional depth control","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"default":"/","description":"Base directory path (default: /)","type":"string"},"max_depth":{"default":3,"description":"Maximum depth to traverse (default: 3)","type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":9007199254740991}},"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"glob","description":"Find files matching a glob pattern (e.g., '**/*.ts' for all TypeScript files)","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"Glob pattern (e.g., '*.ts', '**/*.ts')"},"path":{"default":"/","description":"Base path to search from (default: /)","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"grep","description":"Search for a regex pattern in files. Returns matching files and line numbers","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"pattern":{"type":"string","description":"Regex pattern to search for"},"path":{"default":"/","description":"Base path to search from (default: /)","type":"string"},"glob":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"Optional glob pattern to filter files (e.g., '*.ts')"}},"required":["pattern"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_list_skills","description":"List available workspace skills.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"refresh":{"description":"Refresh skill discovery","type":"boolean"},"active_only":{"description":"Only list active skills","type":"boolean"}},"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_search_skills","description":"Search skill instructions by text query.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string","description":"Search query"},"mode":{"description":"Search mode","type":"string","enum":["bm25","vector","hybrid"]},"top_k":{"default":10,"type":"number"},"snippet_length":{"description":"Snippet length for each result","type":"number"},"lexical_weight":{"description":"Hybrid lexical weight","type":"number"},"vector_weight":{"description":"Hybrid vector weight","type":"number"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_read_skill","description":"Read a skill's instructions from SKILL.md.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"}},"required":["skill_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_activate_skill","description":"Activate a workspace skill.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"}},"required":["skill_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_deactivate_skill","description":"Deactivate a workspace skill.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"}},"required":["skill_id"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_read_skill_reference","description":"Read a skill reference file.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"},"reference":{"type":"string","description":"Reference file path"}},"required":["skill_id","reference"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_read_skill_script","description":"Read a skill script file.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"},"script":{"type":"string","description":"Script file path"}},"required":["skill_id","script"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"workspace_read_skill_asset","description":"Read a skill asset file.","parameters":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","type":"object","properties":{"skill_id":{"type":"string","description":"Skill id or name"},"asset":{"type":"string","description":"Asset file path"}},"required":["skill_id","asset"],"additionalProperties":false},"strict":false}}],"tool_choice":"auto","stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true}}},"warnings":[],"messageId":"fV1TRyYqFhPFvAV2"}

